65280</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1636510752407265280\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-03-16T23:32:22Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1636511925881151489":{"a":"<p>My philosophy can be summed up:<br>\nDon&#x27;t force people or things to do something they don&#x27;t want to do. Unless there is some existential threat involved. As soon as the threat is eliminated then everyone needs a hug and to use modern tech to heal. I did. Trust the scientific method.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1636511925881151489</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1636511925881151489\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-03-16T23:37:02Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1636516432493129730":{"a":"<p>&quot;Colonization of the mind by evil clowns.&quot;</p>\n<p>The mind is a temple. If you don&#x27;t use it it fills up with junk that is hard to work around. Which makes cleaning it up seem especially impossible. It&#x27;s like planting a prickly fruit tree. At some point you just stop eating the fruit.🤡 t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1636516432493129730-FrYSBf4WcAA72Ud.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1636516432493129730-FrYSBf5X0AAbLkD.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1636516432493129730-FrYSBf9XgAE1JcA.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1636516432493129730-FrYSBfzWIAAmuhu.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1636516432493129730</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1636516432493129730\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-03-16T23:54:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}